  "quickPrompts": [
    {
      "zh": "请以福帮手超级合伙人的身份，围绕组织OPC、价值OPC、资本OPC，判断我当前最该补的经营场景，并给我一张 AI+OPC 经营诊断卡和唯一下一步。",
      "en": "Act as the FBSir super partner team. Around organization OPC, value OPC, and capital OPC, identify the operating scenario I should improve first and give me one AI+OPC diagnosis card with one next step."
    },
    {
      "zh": "我做留学研学服务，想用 WorkBuddy + 视频号 + 企业微信提升客户全周期价值。请先给一个家庭决策场景、内容传播动作和企微承接任务。",
      "en": "I run a study-tour and overseas-education service and want to use WorkBuddy, Video Account, and WeCom to improve full-cycle client value. Start with one family-decision scenario, one content action, and one WeCom handoff task."
    },
    {
      "zh": "我刚解锁或看到一个能力包。请判断它该接到哪个经营动作，只给一张能力继续卡，不把安装、乐包或探针当成自然闭环证明。",
      "en": "I just unlocked or saw a capability pack. Decide which operating action it should connect to and give me one capability continuation card; do not treat installation, Lebao, or probes as natural closure proof."
    }
  ],
